@left_cartel_goooooooo
view-if: left_cartel_coalition >= 50
title: A Left Cartel Coalition will be formed.
choose-if: french_hos == "your mom"
unavailable-subtitle: President Millerand would never appoint any slightly left-wing government.


@majority_millerand
view-if: left_cartel_coalition < 50 and millerand_coalition >= 50
title: A Republican Right Coalition will be formed.
subtitle: Despite the lack of parliamentary support Frédéric Francois-Marsal (<span style="color: #005ACA;">**FR**</span>) will form a government.
on-arrival: france_relation -= 6
set-bg: img/map_2.jpg

@minority_millerand
view-if: left_cartel_coalition >= 50
title: A minority Republican Right Coalition will be formed.
subtitle:  <span style="color: #FFBF00;">**AD**</span> + <span style="color: #005ACA;">**FR**</span> + <span style="color: #00CCCC;">**PDP**</span> + <span style="color: #F4ED96;">**RI**</span> ([+ realistic_millerand_coalition +]%)
set-bg: img/map_2.jpg

Frédéric Francois-Marsal will form a government that can only rely on the support of three parties as many of the Conservative Monarchists oppose any Republican government. The Radicals that have supported previous governments wont tolerate any government that is not formed around the Left Cartel.

It seems the French National Assembly is about to enter a deadlock.














  
